{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/19ffe8ddc17f6d944f3a74c7a9259401.avif?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Gods of the Twilight logo\" width=780 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gods of the Twilight is an episodic cyberpunk visual novel where old magic returns to a world of tech. Control two protagonists in parallel as they start to realize they're more than human. Decide who to trust when supernatural and human groups each have their own agendas, and ancient truths about you and your companions start to resurface.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a world where magic has mostly been forgotten, but with Ragnar\u00f6k approaching, strange events are taking shape... especially in the lives of Althea and Farkas, a young woman and man living on the city-ship of New Reykjav\u00edk. You control both of them as they face mysterious assassins, their own emerging abilities, and hints of the roles they may choose to play in world-shaking events to come. They can become friends, rivals, or even lovers with a variety of companions\u2014including each other\u2014as they navigate a web of potential allies and enemies... including gods, monsters, governments, corporations, and criminals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/5347f0b0c4731f64909437acf7818e6f.poster.avif?t=1766362675\" aria-label=\"Animated gif showing characters running and fighting in a cyberpunk city\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/5347f0b0c4731f64909437acf7818e6f.webm?t=1766362675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/5347f0b0c4731f64909437acf7818e6f.mp4?t=1766362675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/e4e563ac4264a10f462f0524dacc8abf.webp?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Features\" width=780 height=63 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced dialog!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how the world ends (hundreds of variables shape your story)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which characters will become your allies, enemies, friends, rivals, or lovers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An episodic story released over time, where choices carry over between chapters and seasons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100k words in the demo and first installment of episodic chapters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/6fc44e1c184040149086c3dff9bab73e.webp?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Characters\" width=780 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two player characters encounter companions who can share their journey toward the apocalypse. It's up to you how these relationships develop, and whether either player character may change allegiances entirely.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/ff113a3a5fdec35bf258db14129d67fd.webp?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Player Characters\" width=780 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/63806bf1074860b7ed3e7a62942d743d.avif?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Althea portrait\" width=780 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Althea Mishra</strong> - A scholarly but sheltered daughter of two high-achieving parents, she\u2019s an intellectual who nonetheless loves dirty jokes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/e9ec2c622e3a64c9c647d96095c50598.avif?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Farkas portrait\" width=780 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farkas Hekluson</strong> - Under the hardened exterior of a guy who survived rough streets growing up, he\u2019s a scarred introvert deeply protective of those he cares about. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/d527fa8f39dc8dfb371b733fdd08bae2.webp?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Companions\" width=780 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/f3493a82b85731ff344136ca02cce999.avif?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Sara portrait\" width=780 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sara Gr\u00edmsd\u00f3ttir</strong> - Sensitivity and strength combined, this mostly soft-spoken girl is just as full of bravery as she is compassion for anyone she encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/7c975c8a88087c6b60ebaeb3484616e4.avif?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Hektor portrait\" width=780 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hektor Koskinen</strong> - A shameless dork, he\u2019s involuntarily wealthy thanks to his CEO father, but nonetheless straightforward and honest to a fault. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/653bceab9d9f1ffd64df2d6ea1eb24d8.avif?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Komani portrait\" width=780 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lieutenant Cebisa Komani</strong> - A duty-driven Icelandic special forces police officer, she\u2019s now an operative for the highly classified international operation dealing with recent supernatural events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/9190747a6b32579b37e35370806cce8b.avif?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Mikael portrait\" width=780 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mikael Pulkkinen</strong> - Hektor\u2019s valet, who has become more like an older brother to him through the years they\u2019ve spent together. Easily sees through bullshit and has zero tolerance for it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/extras/96ec7f3f91dbe8ab44c20e0849b38b97.avif?t=1766362675\" alt=\"Johannes portrait\" width=780 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>J\u00f3hannes Stef\u00e1nsson</strong> - As a personal assistant to Althea's parents, he likes to keep things strictly professional and not reveal much about himself. However, the recent strange occurrences will test the limits of this mask.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And more as the story unfolds!</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Get in the Van!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1528970/9565aa109619bd6ec781c6e43f0a0da7e99322fb.jpg"},{"name":"To the Rescue!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1528970/9998b5018004cc85fde49846103741a4a8441f66.jpg"},{"name":"The Witch-Nun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1528970/be8cde4312d671a454f70c6c7004e319cefad290.jpg"},{"name":"Get Her to the Hospital!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1528970/f02c32431777e3167fb4ba9673f3b63f88611ee3.jpg"},{"name":" Get Him to the Hospital!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1528970/3a090b84d0924aca4b4c0fea9a0f127be37bbbd7.jpg"},{"name":"A Chain Against the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1528970/37df88c5670c123b56b672fa11163e81a696b594.jpg"},{"name":"I Lived B*tch!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1528970/ef655503e8556245ddff6003ab51999fe39533fa.jpg"},{"name":"Changing Handlers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1528970/5286e2f5277f90f9c9bac10af38bb9618dfee0bd.jpg"},{"name":"Sacrifice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1528970/668037cc29bd3bff670fa2dc19e668df0cd0042e.jpg"},{"name":"A Strange Vacation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1528970/cc40002d2a46ef8d490a54155406847a602419c5.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1528970?t=1766362675","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766362675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1528970/bacb0b3c1e5acddf8ed0c115c44594194eb